  {
   "id": 334134,
   "is_answer_order_important": true,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<p><img src=\"exercises/media/5c6d9ccaa6e82f58.jpg\" alt=\"A sphere and a cube are illustrated. They appear to be equal in size\"></p>\n\n<p>Consider the shapes. The diameter of the sphere is equal to 1mm and the side of the cube is also equal to 1mm. Which has a greater volume? Which has a greater surface area?</p>\n",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 842214,
     "content_html": "The cube has the greater volume and greater surface area."
    },
    {
     "id": 842211,
     "content_html": "The sphere has greater surface area and the cube has the greater volume."
    },
    {
     "id": 842212,
     "content_html": "The sphere has the greater surface area and greater volume"
    },
    {
     "id": 842213,
     "content_html": "The cube has the greater volume, and they have the same surface area."
    }
   ],
